      "metadata": {
        "id": "55b04952"
      },
      "source": [
        "The two steps — from SMILES to Mol and from Mol to SMILES — include different arguments that may be useful depending on the specific objectives (see [RDKit documentation](http://rdkit.org/docs/source/rdkit.Chem.rdmolfiles.html) for details). You can refer to the corresponding section in the Classification Model Development Jupyter Notebook for further information."
      ]
