      "source": [
        "Iterate through the elements in the `no_salts` column and create a list called `non_allowed_indx`, which will contain the indices of SMILES entries that include disallowed atoms. The allowed atoms are **H, C, N, O, P, S, Si, F, Cl, Br,** and **I**.\n",
